==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
The English form of {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|Dorothea}}, the name of a legendary (and possibly fictitious) saint, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|Δωροθέα}}, from {{m|grc|δῶρον||gift}} + {{m|grc|θεός||god}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|lang=en|/ˈdɒɹ.ə.θi/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|lang=en|/ˈdɔɹ.ə.θi/|/ˈdɔɹ.θi/}}
* {{a|NYC}} {{IPA|lang=en|/ˈdɑɹ.ə.θi/}}

